---
title: "STANDALONE: browse libraries without Eagle (experimental)"
---
block-beta
    accDescr: The standalone server reads library folders directly, so **Eagle doesn't need to run**. It is **read only**: rating, tagging, uploads and trash need the plugin.<br>With several libraries, choose one with **Switch library** in the viewer's side menu. If the plugin already uses the same port, that server doesn't start.<br>Without **--panel**, it shares the libraries in standalone.json, or, without that file, those selected under **Share only selected libraries**.
    columns 3

